	(text "PC side: USB-C J1 (device, CC 5.1 k), ESD U2, ADuM3160 upstream side powered from VBUS_USB. GND_USB is the PC ground.\nPinball side: PS1 B0505S-1WR3 (1.5 kV) makes +5V; U4 NCP1117-3.3 makes +3V3. GND is the pinball ground.\nR3 330 R loads +3V3 permanently (10 mA) to absorb the current injected by the input dividers when 50 V is applied.\nADuM3160: SPU = VDD1 and SPD = VDD2 select full speed (12 Mbit/s, as the RP2354B); PIN = VDD2 enables the upstream pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
